    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're just a piglet on holiday, visiting your grandpa\u2019s tiny island\u2026 until you stumble into a big, messy mystery. Trash is washing up from somewhere \u2014 and you\u2019re determined to find out why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide through mud, soar through wind tunnels, grind rails, and bounce across islands using parkour moves you learn from the animals who live there. Every new ability helps you reach somewhere new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/f03361bb3197365de3d123cb94a3cac6.poster.avif?t=1749038747\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/f03361bb3197365de3d123cb94a3cac6.webm?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/f03361bb3197365de3d123cb94a3cac6.mp4?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poarker</strong> is a cozy, no-pressure sandbox adventure all about movement, style and helping out. Dress up with silly items, unlock new abilities, and chase high scores as you clean up the islands and piece together what\u2019s really causing the trash problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9e2fe870981f1e3e6814769aec3a5e72.poster.avif?t=1749038747\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9e2fe870981f1e3e6814769aec3a5e72.webm?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9e2fe870981f1e3e6814769aec3a5e72.mp4?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Movement:</strong> Use water currents, mud boosts, wind tunnels, and grind rails to explore however you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trash Cleanup:</strong> Clear trash, earn currency, and trade it for items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Mentors:</strong> Learn skills from the locals!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dress-Up &amp; Play Your Way:</strong> Collect items to shape your outfit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Chill adventure:</strong> No enemies, no stress. Just cozy vibes and island exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/6231260400177e1adbf8bb9517e75d75.poster.avif?t=1749038747\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/6231260400177e1adbf8bb9517e75d75.webm?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/6231260400177e1adbf8bb9517e75d75.mp4?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to master your moves, collect every item, or just vibe with your new animal friends, <strong>Poarker</strong> lets you explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9d5169a3213e8f8cfb31215d0be4c660.poster.avif?t=1749038747\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9d5169a3213e8f8cfb31215d0be4c660.webm?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9d5169a3213e8f8cfb31215d0be4c660.mp4?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're just a piglet on holiday, visiting your grandpa\u2019s tiny island\u2026 until you stumble into a big, messy mystery. Trash is washing up from somewhere \u2014 and you\u2019re determined to find out why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide through mud, soar through wind tunnels, grind rails, and bounce across islands using parkour moves you learn from the animals who live there. Every new ability helps you reach somewhere new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/f03361bb3197365de3d123cb94a3cac6.poster.avif?t=1749038747\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/f03361bb3197365de3d123cb94a3cac6.webm?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/f03361bb3197365de3d123cb94a3cac6.mp4?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poarker</strong> is a cozy, no-pressure sandbox adventure all about movement, style and helping out. Dress up with silly items, unlock new abilities, and chase high scores as you clean up the islands and piece together what\u2019s really causing the trash problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9e2fe870981f1e3e6814769aec3a5e72.poster.avif?t=1749038747\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9e2fe870981f1e3e6814769aec3a5e72.webm?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"