ssets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9d5169a3213e8f8cfb31215d0be4c660.poster.avif?t=1749038747\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9d5169a3213e8f8cfb31215d0be4c660.webm?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659000/extras/9d5169a3213e8f8cfb31215d0be4c660.mp4?t=1749038747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
